# GL features that an MC2_* gate drives and whose VK twin lacks (tools/gl_vk_feature_coverage.py).
# Format: gate | GL shader | WHY   (one line per pair; '#' starts a comment)
#
# Discipline, mirroring tools/glsl_port_diff.allowlist:
#   * a NOT_PORTED row with no entry here is a NEW gap and fails the check;
#   * an entry whose row is no longer NOT_PORTED is STALE and fails the check (delete it);
#   * `py -3 tools/gl_vk_feature_coverage.py --flip-check BASE` fails a commit that turns the
#     default of a gate listed here ON, because the flip would change GL only.
# Only HIGH-confidence rows are enforced; MEDIUM rows are advisory (docs/gl-vk-feature-coverage.md).
# A VK port that spells a GL name in a way no stem rule derives goes into PORTED_AS in the tool, with the
# parity row that proved it, so a closed parity row leaves no entry here.
#
# Sections (2026-10-16 audit): only the first section is parity debt, and each of its entries names the
# open row of .claude/VK-PARITY-GAPS.md it belongs to. Every other section says why the GL default frame
# does not differ from VK there.

# --- Default-ON GL features VK lacks: OPEN parity rows (.claude/VK-PARITY-GAPS.md)
# Ungated features (UNGATED_FEATURES in the tool) are graded under the pseudo-gate UNGATED.
UNGATED | shaders/static_prop.vert | gaps row 28: GL adds the per-instance objective / selection highlight (inst.aRGBHighlight) to static props in the VS and FS; the VK prop island never reads it

# --- Default-ON knobs whose GL block is off by default: no GL pixel depends on them
MC2_MECH_IBL_SH | shaders/mech.frag | read only inside the StandardLit block (u_standardLitEnabled, MC2_STANDARD_LIT_V1 default OFF)
MC2_PBR_AMBIENT_SPECULAR | shaders/mech.frag | read only inside the StandardLit block (MC2_STANDARD_LIT_V1 default OFF)
MC2_PBR_ROUGHNESS_MAX | shaders/mech.frag | read only inside the StandardLit block (MC2_STANDARD_LIT_V1 default OFF)
MC2_PBR_TRIPLANAR_SCALE | shaders/mech.frag | read only inside the StandardLit block (MC2_STANDARD_LIT_V1 default OFF)
MC2_TERRAIN_MACRO_VARIATION_STRENGTH | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | strength of MC2_TERRAIN_MACRO_VARIATION (default OFF)
MC2_TERRAIN_SLOPE_BIAS_STRENGTH | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | strength of MC2_TERRAIN_SLOPE_BIAS (default OFF)
MC2_TERRAIN_VISUAL_DISPLACE_OBJFADE | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.vert | acts only while MC2_TERRAIN_VISUAL_DISPLACE (default OFF) displaces the terrain
MC2_WATER_SHORE_MEANDER_FREQ | shaders/gos_terrain_water_mdi.frag | frequency of MC2_WATER_SHORE_MEANDER, whose amplitude is 0 by default
MC2_SHADOW_STATIC_BANDFIX | shaders/gos_terrain.frag | legacy terrain program, not drawn while MC2_TERRAIN_LOD_CHUNK (default ON) owns terrain
MC2_TERRAIN_NORMAL_ARRAY | shaders/gos_terrain.frag | legacy terrain program, not drawn while MC2_TERRAIN_LOD_CHUNK (default ON) owns terrain
MC2_TERRAIN_NORMAL_ARRAY | shaders/gos_terrain.tese | legacy terrain program, not drawn while MC2_TERRAIN_LOD_CHUNK (default ON) owns terrain

# --- Structural: VK draws LOD0 terrain only (terrain_tier1.vert header), so it has no LOD band to morph or re-strength
MC2_TERRAIN_DETAIL_LOD1_STRENGTH | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | LOD1 detail-normal strength; VK has no LOD1 band
MC2_TERRAIN_LOD_GEOMORPH | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | LOD band morph; VK draws LOD0 everywhere
MC2_TERRAIN_LOD_GEOMORPH | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.vert | LOD band morph; VK draws LOD0 everywhere

# --- GL plumbing, not a pixel: GL's uniform-block switch and the editor's GPU pick buffer (the editor falls back to its CPU pick)
MC2_MECH_VIEWUNIFORMS | shaders/mech.frag | GL view-uniform block switch; VK binds MechFrameUBO always
MC2_MECH_VIEWUNIFORMS | shaders/mech.vert | GL view-uniform block switch; VK binds MechFrameUBO always
MC2_OBJECT_ID_BUFFER | shaders/mech.frag | editor GPU pick id attachment (EditorRenderBridge pickAt path A); no game pixel
MC2_OBJECT_ID_BUFFER | shaders/mech.vert | editor GPU pick id attachment; no game pixel
MC2_OBJECT_ID_BUFFER | shaders/static_prop.frag | editor GPU pick id attachment; no game pixel
MC2_OBJECT_ID_BUFFER | shaders/static_prop.vert | editor GPU pick id attachment; no game pixel
MC2_OBJECT_ID_BUFFER | shaders/static_prop_depth.frag | editor GPU pick id attachment; no game pixel

# --- Default-OFF gates: flipping one ON changes GL only (no parity obligation; the gaps file's default-OFF list)
# MC2_MECH_SURFACE_MATERIAL is a string / mode gate whose table default is empty; empty selects the off path in its reader.
MC2_MECH_BACK_FILL | shaders/mech.frag | uniform u_mechBackFillStrength: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_MECH_SURFACE_MATERIAL | shaders/mech.frag | uniform u_pbrMetallicInfluence, uniform u_pbrRoughnessMax, uniform u_pbrRoughnessMin, uniform u_pbrTileScale, uniform u_pbrWearStrength: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_PBR_METALLIC_INFLUENCE | shaders/mech.frag | uniform u_pbrMetallicInfluence: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_PBR_ROUGHNESS_MIN | shaders/mech.frag | uniform u_pbrRoughnessMin: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_PBR_TILE_SCALE | shaders/mech.frag | uniform u_pbrTileScale: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_PBR_TRIPLANAR | shaders/mech.frag | uniform u_pbrTriplanar: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_PBR_WEAR_STRENGTH | shaders/mech.frag | uniform u_pbrWearStrength: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_PROP_FIXB_MVP | shaders/gos_terrain.vert | uniform mvp: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_PROP_FIXB_MVP | shaders/gos_tex_vertex.vert | uniform mvp: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/legacy_shape_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_PROP_FIXB_MVP | shaders/gos_vertex.vert | uniform mvp: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/legacy_shape_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_PROP_FIXB_MVP | shaders/gos_vertex_lighted.vert | uniform mvp: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/legacy_shape_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_STANDARD_LIT_V1 | shaders/mech.frag | uniform u_standardLitEnabled: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_STATICPROP_MATERIAL_PBR_SLOTS | shaders/static_prop.frag | define MC2_STATICPROP_PBR_SLOTS: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/color_prop_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_STATICPROP_MATERIAL_PBR_SLOTS | shaders/static_prop.vert | define MC2_COALESCE: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/color_prop_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_STATICPROP_MATERIAL_PBR_SLOTS | shaders/static_prop_depth.frag | define MC2_COALESCE, define MC2_STATICPROP_PBR_SLOTS: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/color_prop_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_TERRAIN_DETAIL_ANTITILE | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | uniform detailNormalStrength: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1.*, shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1_skirt.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_TERRAIN_DETAIL_MACRO_STRENGTH | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | uniform detailNormalStrength: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1.*, shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1_skirt.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_TERRAIN_MACRO_VARIATION | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | uniform macroVariationStrength: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1.*, shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1_skirt.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_TERRAIN_SLOPE_BIAS | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | uniform useRockSlopeBias: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1.*, shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1_skirt.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_WATER_BIAS_LEGACY | shaders/gos_terrain_water_fast.vert | uniform u_waterBiasLegacy: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/water_geom.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_WATER_BIAS_LEGACY | shaders/gos_terrain_water_fast_mdi.vert | uniform u_waterBiasLegacy: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/water_geom.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_WATER_REFLECTION_RT | shaders/gos_terrain_water_mdi.frag | uniform u_waterRtStrength: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/water_geom.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_WATER_SHINE | shaders/gos_terrain_water_mdi.frag | uniform u_waterSpecIntensity: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/water_geom.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_WATER_SHORE_MEANDER | shaders/gos_terrain_water_mdi.frag | VK water_geom.frag has no shore-meander block (u_shoreMeanderWu fbm offset on WaterThickness), so VK shorelines stay straight where GL meanders once the amplitude is non-zero. Pinned as the waterBaseColor debt in tools/glsl_port_diff.allowlist.

# --- GL-only diagnostic / debug knobs (no VK equivalent is expected)
MC2_DEBUG_RENDERER | shaders/mech.frag | define MC2_OBJECT_ID_BUFFER: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_DEBUG_RENDERER | shaders/mech.vert | define MC2_OBJECT_ID_BUFFER: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_DEBUG_RENDERER | shaders/static_prop.frag | define MC2_OBJECT_ID_BUFFER: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/color_prop_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_DEBUG_RENDERER | shaders/static_prop.vert | define MC2_COALESCE: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/color_prop_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_DEBUG_RENDERER | shaders/static_prop_depth.frag | define MC2_COALESCE: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/color_prop_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_HDRI_SKY_FRAME_FIX | shaders/hdri_skybox.frag | uniform frameFix: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/hdri_sky.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_HDRI_SKY_UV_DEBUG | shaders/hdri_skybox.frag | uniform uvDebug: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/hdri_sky.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_MECH_FRAG_DEBUG | shaders/mech.frag | uniform u_debugMode: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/mech_tier1.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_SHADER_PATH_TINT | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | uniform u_pathTint: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1.*, shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1_skirt.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_TERRAIN_LOD_CHUNK_DIAG | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | uniform u_diag: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1.*, shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1_skirt.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_TERRAIN_LOD_CHUNK_FORCE_COLOR | shaders/terrain_lod_chunk.frag | uniform u_forceColor: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1.*, shaders/vulkan/terrain_tier1_skirt.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
MC2_WATER_DEBUG_MODE | shaders/gos_terrain_water_mdi.frag | uniform u_waterDebugMode: no such name in the VK twin (shaders/vulkan/water_geom.*) shader, island C++ or gpu_abi
# --- The static sun map's terrain casters (row 17): the VK port draws untessellated world positions with the static matrix
MC2_PROP_FIXB_MVP | shaders/shadow_terrain.vert | uniform mvp: the GL VS writes a screen-space position the TES overrides; the static map depth never reads it (GL/VK static depth dumps match)
MC2_TERRAIN_NORMAL_ARRAY | shaders/shadow_terrain.tese | define TERRAIN_NORMAL_ARRAY: selects the dirt displacement source; the GL static build samples it at uv 0, so the VK port leaves displacement out (GL/VK static depth dumps match)
